</style></div><div class="padding-global padding-section-large"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-large w-container"><div class="helper-lp-folder_wrap"><div class="helper-lp-folder_heading text-color-alternate"><h2 class="text-size-5xl text-size-3xl--tablet text-size-2xl--mobile text-align-center">Eve is powered by Brain AI</h2></div><div class="helper-lp-folder_content"><div class="helper-lp-folder_folder-wrap"><img src="/inspiration/images/6980606a9e70d793c0ec0e63_brain-ai_photo-pack-1.avif" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/inspiration/images/6980606a9e70d793c0ec0e63_brain-ai_photo-pack-1-p-500.avif 500w, /inspiration/images/6980606a9e70d793c0ec0e63_brain-ai_photo-pack-1-p-800.avif 800w, /inspiration/images/6980606a9e70d793c0ec0e63_brain-ai_photo-pack-1.avif 1674w" alt="" class="helper-lp-images_image"><img src="/inspiration/images/691d6303264a7df642c98618_sintra-brain.avif" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/inspiration/images/691d6303264a7df642c98618_sintra-brain-p-500.avif 500w, /inspiration/images/691d6303264a7df642c98618_sintra-brain.avif 1420w" alt="" class="helper-lp-folder_folder-visual"></div><div class="helper-lp-folder_card-wrap hide-tablet"><div class="helper-lp-folder_card _1"><img src="/inspiration/images/69125a44ee547a53ae4c3914__ButtonItem.Leading.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="helper-lp-folder_card-icon"><div class="helper-lp-folder_card-content"><h3 class="helper-lp-folder_card-heading">Companies values (Memory item)</h3><p class="helper-lp-folder_card-paragraph">Safety, Velocity, Speed, Quality.</p></div></div><div class="helper-lp-folder_card _5"><img src="/inspiration/images/69125a44ee547a53ae4c3914__ButtonItem.Leading.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="helper-lp-folder_card-icon"><div class="helper-lp-folder_card-content"><h3 class="helper-lp-folder_card-heading">Brand tone (Memory item)</h3><p class="helper-lp-folder_card-paragraph">Simple, Friendly and Approachable</p></div></div><div class="helper-lp-folder_card _4"><img src="/inspiration/images/69125dd5f7ca61cf0d5874b6_FeaturedIcon2.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="helper-lp-folder_card-icon"><div class="helper-lp-folder_card-content"><h3 class="helper-lp-folder_card-heading">walker_service.docx (file item)</h3><p class="helper-lp-folder_card-paragraph">Walker sells regular trucking services.</p></div></div><div class="helper-lp-folder_card _3"><img src="/inspiration/images/69125dd5f7ca61cf0d5874b6_FeaturedIcon2.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="helper-lp-folder_card-icon"><div class="helper-lp-folder_card-content"><h3 class="helper-lp-folder_card-heading">company_pricing.pdf (file item)</h3><p class="helper-lp-folder_card-paragraph">To revolutionize the travel experience.</p></div></div><div class="helper-lp-folder_card _2"><img src="/inspiration/images/69125dd5964332aa097abfef_FeaturedIcon.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="helper-lp-folder_card-icon"><div class="helper-lp-folder_card-content"><h3 class="helper-lp-folder_card-heading">walkers.com (Webpage item)</h3><p class="helper-lp-folder_card-paragraph">Walkers website home page.</p></div></div></div><div class="helper-lp-folder_cards-mobile hide-desktop"><img src="/inspiration/images/69142e3816dfd75bd089c388_card-group_mobile.avif" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 95vw, 100vw" srcset="/inspiration/images/69142e3816dfd75bd089c388_card-group_mobile-p-500.avif 500w, /inspiration/images/69142e3816dfd75bd089c388_card-group_mobile.avif 994w" alt="" class="helper-lp-folder_cards-mobile-visual"></div></div></div></div></div></section>

<section class="section_helper-lp-knowledge text-color-alternate"><div class="helper-lp-knowledge_styles w-embed"><style>

.helper-lp-knowledge_card p {

font-weight: 500;
opacity: 100%;

}

.helper-lp-knowledge_card p span {

font-weight: 400;
opacity: 50%;

}

</style></div><div class="padding-global"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-large w-container"><div class="helper-lp-knowledge_wrap"><div class="helper-lp-knowledge_heading"><p class="text-size-5xl text-size-3xl--tablet text-size-3xl--mobile text-weight-medium">All your business context in one workspace - a centralized library that brings together your brand details, preferences, and materials to Eve - so nothing gets lost in translation.</p></div><div class="helper-lp-knowledge_content"><div class="helper-lp-knowledge_list"><div id="w-node-_23b47274-98b6-0113-b01e-d89b7ddfa3b3-17d9de49" class="helper-lp-knowledge_card _1"><div id="w-node-_23b47274-98b6-0113-b01e-d89b7ddfa3b4-17d9de49" class="helper-lp-knowledge_card-content _1"><h3 class="text-size-3xl opacity-30 hide-tablet">1. Always up to date</h3><p class="text-size-lg text-size-base--tablet">Brain AI stores your brand context, preferences, and materials, <span>so Soshie doesn’t “forget” how your business works as things evolve.</span></p></div><div class="helper-lp-knowledge_card-visual"><img src="/inspiration/images/691d5c5f0bd1e17fb87495d7_illustrations-mobile-1.avif" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 973px) 95vw, (max-width: 991px) 925px, 100vw" srcset="/inspiration/images/691d5c5f0bd1e17fb87495d7_illustrations-mobile-1-p-500.png 500w, /inspiration/images/691d5c5f0bd1e17fb87495d7_illustrations-mobile-1.avif 925w" alt="" class="helper-lp-knowledge_card-image hide-desktop"><img src="/inspiration/images/691190b52519d79d5f521867_bdc05d463999fc5ec0fcf562bacefdd4_knowledge-card1.avif" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 940px, 100vw" srcset="/inspiration/images/691190b52519d79d5f521867_bdc05d463999fc5ec0fcf562bacefdd4_knowledge-card1-p-500.png 500w, /inspiration/images/691190b52519d79d5f521867_bdc05d463999fc5ec0fcf562bacefdd4_knowledge-card1.avif 1068w" alt="" class="helper-lp-knowledge_card-image hide-tablet"></div></div><div id="w-node-_23b47274-98b6-0113-b01e-d89b7ddfa3c9-17d9de49" class="helper-lp-knowledge_card _2"><div class="helper-lp-knowledge_card-content _2"><h3 class="text-size-3xl opacity-30 hide-tablet">2. Context that compounds</h3><p class="text-size-lg text-size-base--tablet">As you refine strategy, approve content, and ship updates, <span>Brain AI keeps everything connected - no re-explaining, no resets.</span></p></div><div class="helper-lp-knowledge_card-visual _2"><img src="/inspiration/images/691d5c5fecd5037c19cf012d_illustrations-mobile.avif" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 95vw, 100vw" srcset="/inspiration/images/691d5c5fecd5037c19cf012d_illustrations-mobile-p-500.png 500w, /inspiration/images/691d5c5fecd5037c19cf012d_illustrations-mobile.avif 1195w" alt="" class="helper-lp-knowledge_card-image _2 hide-desktop"><img src="/inspiration/images/6911918a206f64ecee2416de_knowledge-card-2.avif" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 940px, 100vw" srcset="/inspiration/images/6911918a206f64ecee2416de_knowledge-card-2-p-500.avif 500w, /inspiration/images/6911918a206f64ecee2416de_knowledge-card-2.avif 1361w" alt="" class="helper-lp-knowledge_card-image _2 hide-tablet"></div></div><div id="w-node-_23b47274-98b6-0113-b01e-d89b7ddfa3be-17d9de49" class="helper-lp-knowledge_card"><div id="w-node-_23b47274-98b6-0113-b01e-d89b7ddfa3bf-17d9de49" class="helper-lp-knowledge_card-content _3"><h3 class="text-size-3xl opacity-30 hide-tablet">3. One source of truth</h3><p class="text-size-lg text-size-base--tablet">Your strategy, voice, and references live in one place, <span>ensuring consistency across every post, campaign, and channel.</span></p></div><div class="helper-lp-knowledge_card-visual"><img src="/inspiration/images/691d5c5f6f82c60963ee9e07_illustrations-mobile-2.avif" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 95vw, 100vw" srcset="/inspiration/images/691d5c5f6f82c60963ee9e07_illustrations-mobile-2-p-500.avif 500w, /inspiration/images/691d5c5f6f82c60963ee9e07_illustrations-mobile-2.avif 1204w" alt="" class="helper-lp-knowledge_card-image _3 hide-desktop"><img src="/inspiration/images/6911921ae2b3f50d86032e4e_64a80dbf885d4584868af19c1893ba83_knowledge-card-3.avif" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 940px, 100vw" srcset="/inspiration/images/6911921ae2b3f50d86032e4e_64a80dbf885d4584868af19c1893ba83_knowledge-card-3-p-500.png 500w, /inspiration/images/6911921ae2b3f50d86032e4e_64a80dbf885d4584868af19c1893ba83_knowledge-card-3.avif 1122w" alt="" class="helper-lp-knowledge_card-image _3 hide-tablet"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>
</div>



